{"version":1,"content":"<p>陳湛文（Peter）、何啟華（Dee）、李佳芯（Ali）及劉漪琳（Eliz）幾位黑色舞台喜劇《見面即地獄》主角，日前突襲主題公園舉行兩場哈囉喂快閃見面會，不僅大談劇中涉及命案、情婦及處理屍體等情節，更與現場觀眾互動，甚至有觀眾不惜「瞓地扮死屍」以贏取舞台劇門票。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T07:18:21.658490+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":131,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T07:02:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T08:18:22.630373+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T07:18:21.658490+00:00","content_hash":"732976fa5a7910233bf3f91cf653048efa39b7d5e09220137ecdc23cded87bfb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}